<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 56.19 to 7000.89. For the week, the Dow rose 123.15 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.59 to 423.83.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.37.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1626 to 869.</p>
<p>Volume was 505,791,620 compared 522,481,410 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,553,711,620 shares.</p>
